(text "R301 and C305 connect OUT to remote sense. Route M15 sense away from LX.\nPlace C305 at the output bank; connect its lower end to the sense trace.\nOutput bank is 88uF nominal; processor bypass adds 70.8uF nominal." (at 187.96 142.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "523f69fa-537e-5eb4-9a79-e25fbd76ab67"))
(text "51k / 100nF enables CPU after VCC3V3_PMU rises.\nVSEL is low at reset; PMIC_SLEEP_H selects register 1 in suspend.\nI2C pull-ups belong on the PMIC/PMUIO2 sheet.\nDo not share VCC5V_SYS with an external USB host VBUS." (at 15.24 165.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e99cbe9a-8e21-528d-a915-57295c0d8eb5"))
(text "RK860 Rev 1.7 and Rockchip tablet reference, p24.\nSPM5030T-R35M: 0.35uH, 4.29mR maximum DCR, 14.9A typical Isat.\nVerify combined-bias capacitance, transient response and thermal limits on prototypes.\nUpstream rails, PMIC and processor I2C/control units remain in progress." (at 187.96 165.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4b1181bc-4408-50c1-9e72-be8acdda2dfa"))
)
